; woods_hollow_tree.room - Oco da Arvore Velha (design 04 section 3.4; WORLD-35 step 2): inside a giant tree west of
; bloom_hollow, climbed up into orchard_mill_town's well (cols 5-8). The hollow is 6 cells wide (cols 4-9, too wide for
; root rungs); its one-way knots alternate west (cols 4-7, rows 39, 28, 18, 6) and east (cols 6-9, rows 33, 23, 12). The
; top landing (row 0, cols 6-7) lies under the well with cols 5 and 8 open to drop past it, between stone lips (cols 4
; and 9) so no root pillar skips it. Every step is 5 or 6 rows (the base jump rises 4.5), so the base kit stops at the
; foot: the double jump climbs each step, and Enraizar grows a pillar from each knot (or the floor) to the underside of
; the overlapping knot above (cols 6-7, 4-5 rows), which the climb's top hop lands on. Going down, step off a knot's open
; end. The side hollow off the row-23 knot (cols 10-15) holds a cache. User, 2026-10-14: "Hollow tree to the orchards
; (Recommended)".

[room]
origin = 0, 0
tileset = spring_woods

